},
{
"type": "text",
"text": "After entering 45.789 via the dialog and saving, the API shows cost=45.79 (legacy 2-decimal column, unchanged behaviour) and cost_decimal=45.789 (true value). Reopening the dialog reads 45.78900 from cost_decimal. A no-op Save & Close leaves cost_decimal=45.789 \u2014 the write-back no longer overwrites it with the rounded number."
}
]
},
{
"type": "paragraph",
"content": [
{
"type": "text",
"text": "Linked purchase-order item: ",
"marks": [
{
"type": "strong"
}
