},
{
"type": "text",
"text": "Ordering the part created PO S-17358 (order 05d729a8, item 63bc67a1) with price=45.79 and price_decimal=\"45.78900\", total_cost_decimal=45.789. Reopening the Edit Part Request window on the ordered part and pressing Save & Close (changing nothing) leaves the PO item price_decimal at \"45.78900\" \u2014 the exact corruption in the root cause no longer happens."
}
]
},
